The [[Titan (NPC)|Titan]] is identical to a [[Burning Titan]] except in name. It appears once, at the end of the [[Abaddon's Mouth]] mission. Defeating it completes the mission. It is not that big of a threat in direct damage done, but people in adjacent range will be given the [[Burning]] condition{{verify}}. It is susceptible to [[cold damage]]{{verify}}.

